 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 666497,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What is the following code's output?\n<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">string_val = \"Hello World\"\nfor c in string_val:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;if c == \" \":\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;break\n&nbsp;&nbsp;print(c)</pre>\n",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1328544,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Hello</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "The loop iterates over characters in the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">string_val</code> variable and until a space character is encountered, prints characters, one in each line. Additionally, print() introduces a newline so the characters will not be printed in the same line."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328545,
     "content_html": "<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Hello World</pre>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "The loop iterates over characters in the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">string_val</code> variable and loop execution terminates as soon as a space character is reached. Hence, the output cannot contain a space character."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328546,
     "content_html": "<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">H\ne\nl\nl\no</pre>\n",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "The code prints all characters before the first occurrence of a space character in separate lines. Hence the output is:\n<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">\nH\ne\nl\nl\no</pre>\n"
    }
   ],
